{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/Gif_NewFirst.gif?t=1753328144\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run a bathhouse visited by animals! <i>Maltese's Fluffy Onsen</i> is a relaxing simulation game that you can enjoy while doing other tasks, as it sits at the bottom of your screen. Place baths with different temperatures and rest areas to help a variety of animal friends unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/Store_Category_Bathhouse_Eng.png?t=1753328144\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Cozy Bathhouse</strong><br>Help your animal guests relax and unwind with a warm bath. Set the water temperature to your liking\u2014cold, warm, or hot\u2014or create special baths using bubble machines and herbal bags.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/Sequence_02.gif?t=1753328144\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Refreshing Drinks and Snacks</strong><br>Create a relaxing space for animals to rest after a good soak. From vending machines with thirst-quenching drinks to snack stands that fill their tummies, you have plenty of options to keep them happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/Gif_Food.gif?t=1753328144\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your Very Own Bathhouse</strong><br>Have you ever dreamed of owning a bathhouse? Design it your way, from nostalgic tiled interiors to open-air baths that warm you up just thinking about them. Make your dream bathhouse a reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/Gif_Set.gif?t=1753328144\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/Store_Category_Customer_Eng.png?t=1753328144\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Variety of Animal Guests</strong><br>Cats, dogs, rabbits, hamsters, and more. Many different guests from the animal world come to relax and unwind. Run your bathhouse and meet all kinds of wonderful visitors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/Gif_Customers.gif?t=1753328144\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Helpful Staff to Lend a Hand</strong><br>Great service takes effort and care. Manage your staff to keep the floors dry and safe, restock supplies, and make sure every guest has a fantastic experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404470/extras/Gif_Staffs.gif?t=1753328144\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(*Please note that the bathing habits of animals in the game may differ from those of real animals.)</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Key to Success","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3404470/f2815c44cccc381a27b083addc04858762fce75c.jpg"},{"name":"Growth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3404470/48e2e84f91bd4120afd1a8e827cdcc98c6e36d28.jpg"},{"name":"Millionaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/